					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mualani"
				},
				{
					"id": 150400706,
					"content": "Duh, sudah enggak sabar nih! Mending pake warna keberuntungan, atau ....",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150400707
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Bennett"
				},
				{
					"id": 150400707,
					"content": "♪",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150400708
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Asha"
				},
				{
					"id": 150400708,
					"content": "♪",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150400709
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Asha"
				},
				{
					"id": 150400709,
					"content": "♪~",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150400710
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Asha"
				},
				{
					"id": 150400710,
					"content": "Wah, komentarnya banyak ya.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150400711
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 150400711,
					"content": "Chasca, yang tadi nangkep enggak? Boleh coba terjemahin lagi?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150400712
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 150400712,
					"content": "Hmm, terlalu panjang. Mesti hitung dulu ada berapa kemungkinan maksudnya ....",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150400713
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Chasca"
				},
				{
					"id": 150400713,
					"content": "#Aku kayaknya paham deh maunya. Asha mau gabung sama aku buat ngelawan {NICKNAME}.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150400714
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Bennett"
				},
				{
					"id": 150400714,
					"content": "Dia suka kerja sama dengan teman-temannya buat bantuin orang yang membutuhkan.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150400715
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Bennett"
				},
				{
					"id": 150400715,
					"content": "Tapi justru unsur lomba yang bisa mengubah kegiatan biasa jadi luar biasa, dari yang datar jadi petualangan seru. Dan dia suka yang kayak gitu.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150400716
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Bennett"
				},
				{
					"id": 150400716,
					"content": "Dia ... dia beneran ngomong sepanjang itu?!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150400717
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 150400717,
					"content": "Kurang lebih lah! Hehe, aku tafsir pakai pemahaman sendiri juga sih sedikit.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150400718
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Bennett"
				},
				{
					"id": 150400718,
					"content": "♪",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150400719
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Asha"
				},
				{
					"id": 150400719,
					"content": "Wah, kayaknya penafsiran kamu benar seratus persen tuh! Ikatan antara kalian berdua semakin kuat ya ....",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150400720
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mualani"
				},
				{
					"id": 150400720,
					"content": "#Oke Asha, aku suka idenya. Tapi kita enggak boleh maksa {NICKNAME} ngerjain sesuatu yang dia enggak mau loh.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150400721
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Bennett"
				},
				{
					"id": 150400721,
					"content": "Selalu hargai perasaan dan pendapat dari teman!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150400722
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Bennett"
				},
				{
					"id": 150400722,
					"content": "♪",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150400723,
						150400726,
						150400729
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Asha"
				},
				{
					"id": 150400723,
					"content": "Kesempatan. Aku sudah lama ingin tantang kapten tim.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150400724
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 150400724,
					"content": "\"Kalau begitu, aku terima tantanganmu.\"",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150400725
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Bennett"
				},
				{
					"id": 150400725,
					"content": "Haha, aku enggak bisa ngomong pakai nada serius kalau muka kamu kayak gitu.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150400732
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Bennett"
				},
				{
					"id": 150400732,
					"content": "Baiklah, kalau kedua tim sudah siap, mari ikut. Aku jadi wasit.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Tikraq"
				},
				{
					"id": 150400726,
					"content": "Yang penting Bennett senang, Asha senang.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150400727
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 150400727,
					"content": "#Enggak bisa gitu! Salah kalau cuma kami doang yang senang. {NICKNAME} juga harus senang!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150400728
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Bennett"
				},
				{
					"id": 150400728,
					"content": "Ayo, gaskan saja dulu! Jangan tegang, nikmati saja!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150400732
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Bennett"
				},
				{
					"id": 150400729,
					"content": "Mau lima lawan satu juga pemenangnya tetap sama.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150400730
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 150400730,
					"content": "#{NICKNAME} pede banget! Oke deh, aku juga mau usahakan yang terbaik!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150400731
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Bennett"
				},
				{
					"id": 150400731,
					"content": "EH, Paimon dianggap apa?! Siapa yang selalu setia di pihak kamu?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150400732
